 S('Speak privately with the classmate','Offer connection without making the conflict public.',{bonds:2,belonging:1,energy:-1},'You learn their perspective.'),
 S('Stay out of it','Protect yourself from group conflict; the rumor continues.',{energy:1,belonging:-1},'Your silence has consequences you may never observe.')],'everyday','ethics'),
M(13,'Teen years','Who are you outside grades?',p=>`You have begun comparing yourself with classmates. You feel pulled between ${p.priority.toLowerCase()} and others' expectations.`,[
 S('Explore an identity beyond school','Join a hobby group or club without aiming to win.',{cash:-100,purpose:2,energy:-1},'You begin to value something not graded.',{set:{identityOutsideAchievement:true}}),
 S('Compete for academic rank','Work hard under public comparison.',{skills:{academics:2},stress:2,energy:-2,options:1},'You gain practice but feel the pressure of comparison.'),
 S('Spend more time with your people','Build belonging while doing fewer extra activities.',{bonds:2,belonging:2,options:-1},'You prioritize being known rather than being ranked.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(14,'Teen years','The group chat goes wrong','A joke in a group chat hurts a friend, but admitting it was insensitive may embarrass you.',[
 S('Apologize and listen','Acknowledge the harm without demanding immediate forgiveness.',{bonds:1,purpose:1,energy:-1},'You try to repair trust.',{special:'socialRepair',set:{accountability:true}}),
 S('Explain why you did not mean harm','Defend your intent while risking dismissal of the other perspective.',{stress:1,bonds:-1,energy:-1},'Your intent and their experience remain different.'),
 S('Leave the chat','Stop the argument but avoid a direct conversation.',{energy:1,belonging:-1},'You escape the conflict without resolving it.')],'everyday','social'),
M(15,'High school','A party or a quiet evening','A friend is hosting a weekend party. You have plans the next morning; nobody has to drink for the event to matter.',[
 S('Go and set a time to leave','Spend time with peers while keeping a schedule.',{bonds:1,belonging:1,energy:-1},'You participate without abandoning your other commitments.',{set:{socialStyle:'balanced'}}),
 S('Stay home to rest','Protect recovery at the cost of some social experiences.',{energy:2,belonging:-1,stress:-1},'You return to school rested.',{set:{socialStyle:'quiet'}}),
 S('Stay out late','Make spontaneous memories but lose sleep.',{bonds:2,energy:-2,stress:1},'You feel connected, but the next morning is harder.',{special:'partyOutcome',set:{socialStyle:'frequent'}})],'everyday','party'),
M(16,'High school','A friendship becomes one-sided','You are always the one reaching out. You value the friendship, but feel unseen.',[
 S('Talk about the imbalance','Risk an awkward conversation to describe what you need.',{stress:1,bonds:1,purpose:1},'You put your needs into words.',{special:'socialRepair',set:{clearBoundaries:true}}),
 S('Continue doing all the work','Keep the relationship going at a personal cost.',{bonds:1,energy:-2,stress:2},'The friendship continues but the imbalance persists.'),
 S('Step away respectfully','Protect your time while grieving a familiar connection.',{bonds:-1,stress:-1,purpose:1},'You create a boundary without knowing what comes next.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(17,'High school','How much does excellence cost?',p=>`You have made progress in ${p.sport||p.interest||'school and life'}. A coach, teacher or supervisor tells you to become exceptional you must prioritize it above almost everything.`,[
 S('Pursue elite performance','Choose intense specialization and sacrifice recovery.',{skills:{sport:1,academics:1},energy:-3,stress:2,recognition:1},'You start chasing exceptional achievement, but not everyone benefits equally from the same intensity.',{set:{eliteMindset:true}}),
 S('Train hard with boundaries','Choose sustainable improvement, knowing progress may be slower.',{skills:{sport:1,academics:1},energy:-1,purpose:1},'You define ambition on terms you can sustain.'),
 S('Explore other goals','Make space for another version of success.',{skills:{art:1,care:1},belonging:1,options:1},'You resist having one measure define your future.')],'major','ambition'),
M(18,'Transition','Family expectations versus your plans',p=>`Your family has strong opinions about your ${p.route||'post-school'} pathway. Their hopes for you do not always match your priorities.`,[
 S('Explain your choice and listen','Try for understanding without promising agreement.',{bonds:1,stress:1,purpose:1},'You make your reasoning visible to people who see the problem differently.',{special:'socialRepair'}),
 S('Follow the advice for now','Gain support but postpone a personal ambition.',{cash:500,bonds:1,purpose:-1},'You protect a relationship while wondering about the path not taken.'),
 S('Choose independently despite objections','Strengthen autonomy but risk conflict and less support.',{purpose:2,options:1,bonds:-2,stress:1},'You choose your path without guaranteed approval.',{set:{independentChoice:true}})],'major','emotions'),
M(19,'Young adulthood','Your first big social circle',p=>p.route==='college'?'On campus, new friends invite you into a group where you feel both excited and out of place.':'At your new workplace or training program, you meet a group with a very different background from yours.',[
 S('Listen first, then share your story','Spend time building reciprocal trust.',{bonds:2,belonging:1,energy:-1},'You find common ground across different experiences.'),
 S('Act more confident than you feel','Make a strong impression while managing the strain.',{options:1,bonds:1,stress:2},'Other people see your confidence, but not necessarily your experience.'),
 S('Keep your circle small','Protect privacy while developing fewer new connections.',{energy:1,belonging:-1,purpose:1},'Your social world stays manageable.')],'everyday','social'),
M(19,'Young adulthood','A college party',p=>p.route==='college'?'A residence-hall party is happening tonight. You have classes, practice, or work tomorrow.':'Friends from a nearby college invite you to their weekend party. You have responsibilities tomorrow.',[
 S('Go to connect, leave early','Enjoy people and preserve much of tomorrow.',{bonds:2,energy:-1,belonging:1},'You gain shared memories without staying the whole night.',{set:{partyPreference:'sometimes'}}),
 S('Stay the whole night','Enjoy the social moment, but give up sleep and prep time.',{bonds:2,energy:-3,stress:1},'You have fun, but your next obligation gets harder.',{special:'partyOutcome',set:{partyPreference:'frequent'}}),
 S('Choose a smaller gathering instead','Spend time with a few people on terms you prefer.',{bonds:1,energy:1,belonging:1},'You learn that belonging does not require a crowd.',{set:{partyPreference:'small'}}),
 S('Skip and study or rest','Protect your needs while missing part of the social scene.',{energy:2,skills:{academics:1},belonging:-1},'You prioritize another commitment.',{set:{partyPreference:'rare'}})],'everyday','party'),
M(20,'Young adulthood','How often will you go out?',p=>`People around you are establishing routines. So far your social style is ${p.flags.partyPreference||p.flags.socialStyle||'undecided'}. You can change your habits.`,[
 S('Go out most weekends','Develop a large social network but lose more time and money.',{cash:-650,bonds:2,belonging:2,energy:-2,stress:1},'Your calendar fills with social events.',{set:{partyFrequency:'often'},later:{offset:4,delta:{energy:-1},text:'Several busy weeks leave you short of recovery time.'}}),
 S('Go out occasionally','Maintain a balance that still requires planning.',{cash:-240,bonds:1,belonging:1,energy:-1},'You make time for people without structuring your whole week around events.',{set:{partyFrequency:'sometimes'}}),
 S('Mostly stay in or host quiet evenings','Keep routines and spending stable, but some friendships need extra outreach.',{cash:150,energy:2,belonging:-1},'You protect recovery and choose a smaller social world.',{set:{partyFrequency:'rare'}})],'everyday','party'),
M(20,'Young adulthood','An invitation to belong','A student organization or workplace group offers you a role, but others expect you to change your style to fit in.',[
 S('Join without changing your boundaries','Seek connection while being clear about your limits.',{bonds:1,belonging:2,stress:1},'You test whether belonging can accommodate your differences.'),
 S('Blend in to avoid friction','Gain short-term acceptance at the cost of some authenticity.',{bonds:2,belonging:1,purpose:-1,stress:1},'Your outward behavior does not show your internal conflict.'),
 S('Find another group','Spend time searching for a more comfortable community.',{energy:-1,purpose:1,options:1},'You keep looking for people who share your values.')],'everyday','social'),
M(21,'Young adulthood','Drinking at a party',p=>p.route==='college'?'At a college party, friends offer you alcohol. You are 21 in this simulated US setting and can legally choose whether to drink.':'At a celebration with friends and coworkers, alcohol is being served. You are 21 in this simulated US setting.',[
 S('Do not drink','Keep a clear head and participate socially on your terms.',{energy:1,purpose:1,belonging:1},'You socialize without drinking.',{set:{drinkingPattern:'abstinent'}}),
 S('Have a drink and arrange a safe ride','Spend on a drink while maintaining clear transport plans; social outcomes are uncertain.',{cash:-35,bonds:1,energy:-1},'You make a limited choice and avoid driving after drinking.',{special:'adultPartyOutcome',set:{drinkingPattern:'occasional'}}),
 S('Drink more than you intended','Give in to social pressure, with greater uncertainty and real safety risks.',{cash:-125,energy:-2,stress:1},'You notice the pressure to keep up with others.',{special:'excessDrinking',set:{drinkingPattern:'frequent'}}),
 S('Leave when pressured','Honor a personal boundary but miss part of the night.',{energy:2,belonging:-1,purpose:1},'You leave safely without explaining your decision to everyone.',{set:{drinkingPattern:'abstinent',boundariesAroundAlcohol:true}})],'major','party'),
M(21,'Young adulthood','A friend does not seem safe','At a gathering, a friend appears impaired and wants to travel alone. Your immediate obligations are real, but so is concern for them.',[
 S('Stay and help arrange safe transport','Invest time and care rather than letting them travel impaired.',{energy:-2,bonds:2,purpose:1,stress:1},'You help your friend find a safe ride or trusted support.',{set:{helpedFriend:true}}),
 S('Ask a sober person or staff member to help','Share the responsibility while protecting your own safety.',{bonds:1,energy:-1,options:1},'You enlist help rather than managing the situation alone.'),
 S('Tell them to stay and contact someone trusted','Try to set a clear safety boundary from where you are.',{energy:-1,stress:1,bonds:1},'You encourage a safer option without guaranteeing that they will listen.')],'everyday','ethics'),
M(22,'Early career','Is your network a genuine friendship?','A contact can introduce you to an influential employer. They also act dismissively toward one of your closest friends.',[
 S('Challenge the disrespect','Protect a friend while jeopardizing the introduction.',{purpose:2,bonds:1,options:-1,stress:1},'You make a relationship boundary visible.',{special:'socialRepair'}),
 S('Use the introduction and keep distance','Try to gain the opportunity without endorsing the behavior.',{options:2,stress:1,purpose:-1},'Your actions and values may remain in tension.'),
 S('Avoid the contact entirely','Preserve autonomy but lose a possible opening.',{bonds:1,purpose:1,options:-1},'You decline the opportunity on your own terms.')],'major','ethics'),
M(23,'Early career','The comparison trap',p=>`Someone from school seems to be far ahead in money, career or visibility. You currently work toward ${careerInfo[p.career]?.name||'a new direction'}.`,[
 S('Use the comparison as information','Ask what skills and conditions contributed to their result.',{skills:{business:1},stress:-1,options:1},'You learn without assuming the difference is intelligence.'),
 S('Double your workload','Increase effort and exposure while sacrificing rest.',{cash:800,skills:{academics:1},energy:-2,stress:2},'You pursue the visible result more intensely.'),
 S('Step away from the comparison','Protect your sense of meaning rather than competing for appearances.',{purpose:2,energy:1,recognition:-1},'You reconsider what success means to you.')],'everyday','ambition'),
M(24,'Early career','An idea for a business',p=>`You see a problem in ${p.sport?'sports and youth programs':'your work or community'} that a small business might help solve. Having an idea is not the same as having customers.`,[
 S('Interview potential customers','Use evenings to discover whether people actually need your solution.',{cash:-250,energy:-1,skills:{business:2},options:1},'You gather evidence before risking large sums.',{set:{businessInterest:true,validatedIdea:true}}),
 S('Build a prototype','Invest money and creative energy in a first version.',{cash:-800,energy:-2,skills:{tech:1,business:1},purpose:1},'You create something tangible with uncertain demand.',{set:{businessInterest:true,prototype:true}}),
 S('Keep your present job for now','Preserve stability while learning from others.',{cash:500,energy:1,options:-1},'You delay entrepreneurship; this need not be your only chance.')],'everyday','business'),
M(25,'Adulthood','How to repair a deep disagreement','A partner, family member, or close friend says you have not been listening. You remember the same interactions differently.',[
 S('Ask for their perspective without arguing','Listen and acknowledge that experiences can diverge.',{bonds:2,belonging:1,energy:-1,stress:1},'The conversation becomes more specific, though not everything is settled.',{special:'socialRepair'}),
 S('Describe your own needs clearly','Assert your point of view while risking escalation.',{purpose:1,bonds:-1,stress:1},'Your experience becomes visible, but the conversation is tense.'),
 S('Take space and agree to revisit it','Protect short-term calm but leave a future responsibility.',{energy:1,stress:-1,bonds:-1},'You postpone the conversation instead of resolving it immediately.',{later:{offset:5,delta:{bonds:-1,stress:1},text:'The unresolved conversation returns at an inconvenient time.'}})],'major','emotions'),
M(26,'Adulthood','A choice about public recognition','You have been doing good work, but someone more visible receives public credit. You can confront the situation or continue quietly.',[
 S('Present evidence of your contributions','Advocate for recognition at a political cost.',{energy:-1,options:1,stress:1,recognition:1},'You advocate for your work.',{special:'recognition'}),
 S('Ask colleagues to advocate together','Build shared recognition instead of an individual spotlight.',{bonds:2,energy:-1,recognition:1},'Other people understand the contributions better.'),
 S('Focus on the work, not the credit','Preserve energy but risk missing a future opportunity.',{purpose:1,energy:1,options:-1},'You choose meaning over immediate recognition.')],'everyday','ambition'),
M(27,'Adulthood','Love, partnership, and autonomy','A person you care about wants a clearer commitment while you are considering a major professional move.',[
 S('Build a committed partnership','Invest mutual effort while accepting compromise.',{bonds:2,belonging:2,energy:-1,purpose:1},'You and another person start building a shared plan.',{set:{partnered:true}}),
 S('Pursue the move and keep things open','Prioritize movement and independence while accepting uncertainty.',{options:2,bonds:-1,purpose:1,stress:1},'You choose flexibility over commitment.',{set:{partnered:false}}),
 S('Have an honest conversation without deciding yet','Seek clarity while staying with uncertainty.',{bonds:1,stress:1,purpose:1},'Neither person gets a guarantee, but both hear the truth.',{special:'socialRepair'})],'major','emotions'),
M(28,'Adulthood','Do you want to be the best?',p=>`You have experience in ${careerInfo[p.career]?.name||'your field'}. A respected person tells you that reaching the top takes years of deliberate practice, strategic support, and luck.`,p=>[
 S('Pursue exceptional mastery','Develop a focused long-term goal and accept added pressure.',{energy:-3,stress:2,skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:2},recognition:1,purpose:1},'You commit to an elite standard, but not necessarily a higher quality of life.',{set:{excellence:'elite'}}),
 S('Become highly capable with a sustainable routine','Advance while protecting relationships and recovery.',{energy:-1,stress:-1,purpose:2,skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:1}},'You define excellence more broadly.',{set:{excellence:'sustainable'}}),
 S('Use your skills to help others grow','Shift focus to service and developing new talent.',{bonds:2,belonging:1,skills:{care:1},options:1},'You make mastery something shared.',{set:{excellence:'mentorship'}})],'major','ambition'),
M(29,'Adulthood','A rejection you did not expect',p=>`You apply for a selective opportunity in ${careerInfo[p.career]?.name||'your chosen field'}. Your qualifications are real, but competition and evaluation are imperfect.`,p=>[
 S('Seek feedback and reapply','Improve your approach, while risking further disappointment.',{skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:1},stress:1,energy:-1,options:1},'You try again, knowing a second application is not guaranteed to succeed.',{special:'recognition'}),
 S('Take a different path','Use the setback to explore another setting.',{options:1,purpose:1,recognition:-1},'You change the measure of success rather than abandoning growth.'),
 S('Pause before making a big change','Recover and avoid a reactive decision.',{energy:2,stress:-2,options:-1},'You make space to process the rejection.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(30,'Adulthood','Who counts as your family?',p=>p.flags.partnered?'You and your partner discuss the future. Shared plans require compromise and resources.':'People close to you ask how you want your home and family life to develop. There is no universal timetable.',[
 S('Make a long-term shared home plan','Invest in stability, even when it narrows future flexibility.',{cash:-1500,bonds:2,belonging:2,options:-1},'You build a shared household.',{set:{sharedHome:true}}),
 S('Build a chosen family and friendships','Invest deeply in people without committing to one conventional life structure.',{bonds:2,belonging:2,energy:-1},'Your support network grows beyond formal labels.',{set:{chosenFamily:true}}),
 S('Prioritize independence for now','Protect mobility and personal focus, with some relational distance.',{options:2,energy:1,bonds:-1},'You organize life around personal freedom.',{set:{sharedHome:false}})],'major','social'),
M(31,'Adulthood','A friendship you neglected',p=>`A friend says you are always too busy. Your priorities and stress level (${p.stress}/10 in this fictional model) have affected your calendar.`,[
 S('Make a recurring plan','Rebuild connection at the expense of some free time.',{bonds:2,belonging:2,energy:-1},'Trust grows through consistent action.',{special:'socialRepair'}),
 S('Explain the pressure without promising more','Offer honesty, but little change to your schedule.',{purpose:1,stress:-1,bonds:-1},'Your friend understands more, but still feels distance.'),
 S('Let the friendship change','Accept a smaller connection without forcing it.',{bonds:-1,energy:1,stress:-1},'You allow your social world to evolve.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(32,'Adulthood','Launch a specific business',p=>`You've ${p.flags.validatedIdea?'talked to potential customers':'considered what a community might need'}. You have ${usd(p.cash)} available, but cash is not the same as reliable future revenue.`,p=>[
 ...[
 ['sports','Sports training and youth coaching','sport'],
 ['tech','Web tools or IT services','tech'],
 ['community','Community education and tutoring','care'],
 ['creative','Design, media or dance studio','art'],
 ['food','Catering or food service','craft'],
 ['repairs','Home repair and trade services','craft']
 ].map(([id,name,skill])=>S(name,`Start a real venture based on ${skill} practice. Setup costs money; customers are uncertain.`,{cash:-2400,stress:2,energy:-2,skills:{business:1,[skill]:1},purpose:1},`You register the idea and begin looking for paying customers for ${name.toLowerCase()}.`,{special:'businessLaunch',set:{ventureKind:id,businessInterest:true}})),
 S('Stay employed and test a side project','Preserve your main income, while leaving less time for expansion.',{cash:-300,stress:1,energy:-1,skills:{business:1},purpose:1},'You postpone a full launch while testing demand.',{set:{businessInterest:true,sideHustle:true}}),
 S('Decide not to start a business','Choose a different kind of ambition without treating entrepreneurship as superior.',{energy:1,stress:-1,purpose:1},'You seek meaningful growth through other routes.')],'major','business'),
M(33,'Adulthood','Your first business customers',p=>p.venture?`Your ${ventureNames[p.venture.kind]||'small business'} has ${p.venture.customers||0} early customer relationships. You need to decide how to build trust.`:'A friend asks you to help with a small business. You can still learn business decisions without owning a company.',p=>[
 S('Provide excellent service before expanding','Invest in quality, and accept slower revenue.',{cash:-600,energy:-2,purpose:1,recognition:1,skills:{business:1}},'You put trust before speed.',{special:'ventureCustomers',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active business'}),
 S('Run a low-cost advertising campaign','Try to reach more people, paying for uncertain attention.',{cash:-1250,energy:-1,stress:1,skills:{business:1}},'Marketing brings exposure, not guaranteed purchases.',{special:'ventureMarketing',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active business'}),
 S('Learn how small firms operate','Build transferable skills while retaining your current job.',{skills:{business:2},bonds:1,energy:-1},'You learn from another entrepreneur without risking ownership.')],'everyday','business'),
M(34,'Adulthood','A team or a solo path',p=>p.venture?'Your business needs more help. Hiring has human obligations as well as financial cost.':'An organization asks if you want to lead a new project with others.',[
 S('Commit full-time to your own business','Leave your regular salary and depend on uncertain business income; household expenses remain.',{cash:-600,stress:2,energy:-1,purpose:1},'You become a full-time founder rather than a wage employee. Operating costs and revenue will change with the venture.',{when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active venture',set:{career:'founder',fullTimeFounder:true}}),
 S('Bring in a partner or collaborator','Share authority, workload and eventual rewards.',{cash:-1000,bonds:1,energy:1,stress:1,skills:{business:1}},'You learn that expertise is collective.',{special:'venturePartner',set:{collaborative:true}}),
 S('Work alone and keep control','Retain autonomy but absorb more demands.',{energy:-2,stress:2,options:1},'You become responsible for more outcomes.',{set:{soloBuilder:true}}),
 S('Build a community cooperative project','Make impact a shared decision, while accepting slower processes.',{bonds:2,purpose:2,cash:-750,energy:-1},'A group develops the project together.',{set:{cooperative:true}})],'everyday','business'),
M(35,'Midlife','What your work says about you',p=>`People often judge others by their title. You currently identify with ${careerInfo[p.career]?.name||'your developing roles'}, but feel your life is more complicated.`,p=>[
 S('Build a life outside work','Spend resources on friends, art or sports.',{cash:-650,purpose:2,belonging:2,energy:1},'You invest in an identity that survives job changes.'),
 S('Become known for excellent work','Seek visibility and recognition while increasing pressure.',{skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:1},recognition:2,energy:-2,stress:2},'Your professional identity becomes more visible.',{special:'recognition'}),
 S('Change how you talk about success','Stop evaluating every part of life by status.',{stress:-2,purpose:1,bonds:1},'You adjust your own internal yardstick.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(36,'Midlife','Your business faces competition',p=>p.venture?`Another company is offering a cheaper alternative to ${ventureNames[p.venture.kind]||'your business'}. Your cash is ${usd(p.cash)} and your reputation is ${p.recognition}/10.`:'A colleague asks for help adapting to competition. Your own career is changing too.',p=>[
 S('Differentiate on service and quality','Spend time improving outcomes for clients.',{cash:-850,energy:-2,purpose:1,skills:{business:1}},'You pursue a distinctive value rather than copying competitors.',{special:'ventureCustomers',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active venture'}),
 S('Reduce prices and seek volume','Accept smaller margins in the hope of more customers.',{cash:-1200,stress:2,energy:-1},'You make an uncertain competitive move.',{special:'ventureMarketing',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active venture'}),
 S('Use transferable skills in your career','Choose flexibility without owning the business.',{options:2,energy:-1,skills:{business:1}},'You develop ways to respond to changing conditions.')],'everyday','business'),
M(37,'Midlife','The emotional cost of ambition',p=>`You have been pursuing ${p.flags.excellence==='elite'?'an exceptional standard':p.priority.toLowerCase()}. Your stress tracker reads ${p.stress}/10. Other people cannot see everything behind that number.`,p=>[
 S('Ask for support and rest','Reduce pressure, even if achievements come more slowly.',{stress:-3,energy:2,bonds:1,recognition:-1},'You deliberately make room for recovery.'),
 S('Keep pursuing the goal intensely','Seek achievement while accepting greater strain.',{skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:1},recognition:1,stress:2,energy:-2},'You continue chasing an uncertain breakthrough.',{special:'masteryBreakthrough'}),
 S('Change the goal to match your values','Rebalance purpose and reputation.',{purpose:2,stress:-1,options:-1},'You decide that changing direction is not failure.')],'major','ambition'),
M(39,'Midlife','A community tragedy','Something difficult happens in your community. People cope differently, and no one response proves who is stronger.',[
 S('Offer practical assistance','Contribute time, even while managing your own feelings.',{bonds:2,purpose:1,energy:-2,stress:1},'You help with immediate needs.'),
 S('Seek connection and support','Make room to process what happened with others.',{bonds:1,belonging:2,energy:1,stress:-1},'You share the burden without having to solve everything.'),
 S('Give yourself privacy','Protect personal space while remaining aware of others.',{energy:2,belonging:-1,stress:-1},'You process the event privately.')],'everyday','emotions'),
M(40,'Midlife','A selective award or invitation',p=>`Someone nominates you for recognition in ${careerInfo[p.career]?.name||'your field'}. They cannot guarantee the committee will select you.`,p=>[
 S('Submit a serious application','Invest time and expose your work to judgment.',{energy:-2,stress:1,recognition:1,skills:{[careerInfo[p.career]?.skill||'academics']:1}},'You put your work forward.',{special:'masteryBreakthrough'}),
 S('Nominate someone overlooked','Share opportunity rather than seeking the spotlight.',{bonds:2,purpose:2,recognition:-1},'You use the moment to make other work visible.'),
 S('Decline for now','Protect privacy and energy at the expense of a possible prize.',{energy:2,stress:-1,options:-1},'You do not participate in this round.')],'everyday','ambition'),
M(42,'Midlife','An ethical shortcut at work','A manager asks you to exaggerate a project’s success in a public report. The pressure is real.',[
 S('Refuse to distort the results','Act on your standards, risking retaliation.',{purpose:2,stress:2,options:-1},'You decline to make a claim the evidence cannot support.',{special:'ethicsOutcome'}),
 S('Suggest an accurate, qualified report','Look for a defensible solution with political costs.',{skills:{business:1},stress:1,options:1},'You present uncertainty rather than hiding it.',{special:'ethicsOutcome'}),
 S('Follow the manager’s instruction','Protect short-term position while compromising trust.',{cash:1000,recognition:1,purpose:-2,stress:2},'You gain short-term benefit but risk future accountability.',{later:{offset:7,delta:{cash:-2300,recognition:-2},text:'The inaccurate report prompts a difficult review.'}})],'major','ethics'),
M(43,'Midlife','Does your business still represent your goals?',p=>p.venture?`Your ${ventureNames[p.venture.kind]||'business'} may grow or remain small. It also occupies attention you could spend elsewhere.`:'You are considering whether to start a project later in life or invest in community organizations instead.',p=>[
 S('Hire or promote a team lead','Accept higher costs and shared control for sustainable work.',{cash:-1700,bonds:1,energy:2,stress:-1},'You build an organization rather than a one-person job.',{special:'venturePartner',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active business'}),
 S('Pursue rapid growth','Accept significant expenses and uncertainty.',{cash:-3400,energy:-2,stress:2,recognition:1},'You try to scale beyond your current reach.',{special:'ventureScale',when:p=>!!p.venture,lock:'Requires an active business'}),
 S('Build a shared local project','Invest in a mission rather than chasing financial size.',{cash:-800,bonds:2,purpose:2,options:1},'You begin or contribute to a community project.',{set:{communityProject:true}})],'everyday','business'),
